📄 PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (PRD)
👗 Sketch to Stitch
1. 📌 Product Overview
Product Name:

Sketch to Stitch

Vision:

To build an immersive fashion design platform where users can:

Browse a fashion catalog
Customize clothing designs
Visualize outfits in real-time 3D
Generate sewing patterns and step-by-step garment construction guides

The system combines fashion design + 3D visualization + AI-assisted customization into a single unified platform.

2. 🎯 Problem Statement

Current fashion design workflows are:

Fragmented across multiple tools (sketching, CAD, pattern making)
Expensive and not beginner-friendly
Not interactive in real-time 3D
Lack AI assistance for design ideation
Problem:

Designers cannot easily:

Visualize clothing on a body in real time
Rapidly prototype clothing variations
Convert design ideas into sewing patterns automatically
3. 🚀 Solution

A web-based platform that provides:

Core capabilities:
Interactive fashion catalog (UI-driven selection)
Custom clothing design system
Real-time 3D visualization on a mannequin
AI-inspired design suggestions (future phase)
Automated sewing pattern generation
4. 👤 Target Users
Fashion design students
Independent fashion designers
Tailors and garment creators
UI/UX + AI project evaluators
Fashion tech researchers
5. 🧱 System Architecture
Frontend
React.js
Three.js / React Three Fiber
Zustand / useState for state management
CSS (glassmorphism + cinematic UI)
Backend
FastAPI (Python)
REST APIs for:
Design generation
Pattern generation
Catalog data handling
3D Engine
Three.js
FBX/GLTF model support
Orbit controls for user interaction
6. 🧭 Core Features
6.1 Cinematic Landing Page
Description:

A motion-based homepage that feels like a fashion film.

Features:
Fullscreen animated fashion visuals
Parallax motion layers
Floating designer imagery
Scroll-based storytelling
“Enter Studio” CTA
Goal:

Create a luxury brand-like first impression.

6.2 Fashion Catalog System
Description:

Pinterest-style grid of clothing categories.

Categories:
Shirts
Tops
Pants
Dresses
Jackets
Skirts
Features:
Hover animations
Selection system
Visual preview cards
Category-based filtering
6.3 Design Customization Engine
Description:

Dynamic clothing parameter system.

Inputs:
Fabric type (cotton, silk, denim, wool)
Sleeve design
Neck design
Pattern type
Color selection
Body measurements
Style description (text input)
Output:

Structured design configuration object.

6.4 3D Visualization System
Description:

Real-time rendering of clothing on a mannequin.

Features:
Load FBX/GLTF model (fashion body)
Rotate / zoom / pan
Lighting studio environment
Outfit preview updates
Requirements:
Model isolation (no UI overlap)
Stable rendering pipeline
Performance optimized scene
6.5 Pattern Generation System
Description:

Converts design into sewing instructions.

Output:
2D garment patterns
Labelled sections:
Front panel
Back panel
Sleeves
Collar
Instructions:

Step-by-step tailoring guide:

Fabric cutting
Stitching sequence
Assembly order
Finishing details
6.6 AI Design Layer (Future Scope)
Features:
Trend-based recommendations
Auto design suggestions from text prompts
Style enhancement engine
